{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "74cbfce0-f8b8-46a1-b5d6-38477d4eec99"/*SetFog*/,
  "Description": "Adds distance fog to the connected subgraph.\n\nThe fog is applied by the draw operators (e.g. [DrawMesh], [DrawLines]) based on the distance to the camera. It increases from the camera position and fully covers the content at Distance.\n\nAKA: haze, mist, atmosphere, depthcue\n\nTips:\n- Fog is computed per vertex in most draw operators. If large meshes (e.g. a ground plane) are not properly covered, increase their tessellation.\n- Use the alpha channel of Color to fade the fog effect.\n- [ColorGradeDepth] colors distant objects differently than close ones as a post effect.\n\nSee also: [SetEnvironment], [DepthBufferAsGrayScale], [ColorGradeDepth]",
  "SymbolTags": "1",
  "InputUis": [
    {
      "InputId": "53479387-1c04-4fbc-b093-043075495e10"/*Bias*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 90.0
      },
      "Description": "Exponent of the fog gradient. Values above 1 keep close areas clear and let the fog increase steeply towards Distance. Values below 1 make the fog appear close to the camera.",
      "Min": 0.0,
      "Max": 10.0
    },
    {
      "InputId": "7a331539-33ea-48b9-8930-daf93dd33d7c"/*Distance*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 45.0
      },
      "Description": "Distance from the camera at which the fog fully covers the content. 0 disables the fog.",
      "AddPadding": "True",
      "Min": 0.0,
      "Max": 100.0,
      "Scale": 0.1,
      "ClampMin": true
    },
    {
      "InputId": "afadb109-37b2-49aa-8c32-627cc35fd574"/*Command*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "InputId": "ef8c86ee-16c0-446e-9ce0-c6342adbf32a"/*Color*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 135.0
      },
      "Description": "Color of the fog. The alpha channel controls the fog strength.",
      "AddPadding": "True"
    }
  ],
  "SymbolChildUis": [],
  "OutputUis": [
    {
      "OutputId": "7c2134d1-45c6-4dc7-b591-a4a5113f5747"/*Output*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 0.0,
        "Y": 0.0
      }
    }
  ]
}